	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"The pickaxes to the &cright&r of the main path are ones that are the same tier as the ones to the left of them, &9but aren't specifically required to progress.&r"
				""
				"The pickaxes to the &aleft&r of the main path are ones that are the same/different tier as the ones to the right of them, but&9 require the pickaxe tier to the right of them.&r"
				""
				"You can obtain some vanilla and modded materials in a &n&ddifferent&r&r way now, for example obtaining Netherite requires a create mod mixing heated basin, same goes for Iridium from Terramity and some other custom materials I featured in this modpack."
			]
